Hold the punch button, then release to strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning Over Drive</strong>: Press the slow button to slow time (consumes energy gauge).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea About the Developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LeftOver</strong> is a new indie label founded by just two developers.<br>Everything\u2014from planning, programming, and design, to sound and beyond\u2014<br>is created entirely by the two of us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're taking our time to build something special,<br>and we truly appreciate your support and wishlist additions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bPerformance Notes</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're using a monitor with a refresh rate higher than 60Hz,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you may experience issues where the game runs too fast or too slow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In such cases, try turning off vertical sync (vSync) in the game's settings.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The BGM and sound effect volume settings are currently locked as we are still making adjustments. They are expected to be adjustable in the next update.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["LeftOver"],"dlc":[3681130],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/d22f8bbbc6b7a4e4aa0bff9d0dee9fca635e1559/header.jpg?t=1767716607","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2389830/328472254/1dbd07a45c17640c0fe8fb0c03f972608e1bc993/1759126676/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759135430","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2389830/328472254/1dbd07a45c17640c0fe8fb0c03f972608e1bc993/1759126676/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759135430","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https: